    "content_padding_end": "Flutter uses start 16 / end 24 (EdgeInsetsDirectional.only(start: 16, end: 24)); Compose uses start 16 / end 16. Both are 'M3'; end 24 is the newer/expressive figure Flutter ships. Quasar's own q-item uses its own padding scale, so this only applies where the preset claims spec parity.",
